From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:13:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: skip image parsing for text without image markers

Inline and reference Markdown images require a literal exclamation mark.
Return the existing empty result before parsing text without that marker.
Keep the full parser and preview domain checks for all other inputs.

Add syntax regressions for encoded and escaped punctuation, code and image
references, plus real history preparation benchmarks with image controls.

Mattermax-Patch: markdown-image-scan.patch
